From: Joel Selvaraj <foss@joelselvaraj.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Aug 2024 20:44:20 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] sdm845.config: enable pixel downstream touchscreen driver

(cherry picked from commit 0e883317014d91cc4af7c9e0434dba4869298093)
Link: https://gitlab.com/sdm845-mainline/linux
Signed-off-by: Richard Acayan <mailingradian@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/sdm845.config | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/sdm845.config b/arch/arm64/configs/sdm845.config
index 4b58274..b770968 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/sdm845.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/sdm845.config
@@ -31,6 +31,7 @@ CONFIG_SND_SOC_TFA989X=m
 
 # Pixel 3
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_LG_SW43408=y
+CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_STM_FTS_DOWNSTREAM=m
 
 # Odin
 # Driver has been dropped
